THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

EvidenceCrew itself has no bundled third-party libraries: it depends only on the
Node.js standard library.

It drives two external programs that are NOT distributed with it and are NOT
covered by its licence:

  * Google Chrome or Chromium - used as the browser for the ChatGPT worker
    transport. Governed by its own licence and terms.
  * @playwright/cli - invoked at run time from the user's own npx cache to drive
    that browser. Governed by its own licence (Apache-2.0).

It also communicates with remote services chosen and configured by the user
(for example the DeepSeek API), which are governed by their own terms of service.
No remote service is bundled, redistributed or sublicensed by this project.

